  "description": "Client / master runtime: association management, service invocation API, report subscription, control sequencing (select-before-operate), reconnection/retry logic. Optionally validates a live discovered model (via GetDirectory/GetDataDirectory) against an SCL-provided expected/offline model (Iec61850.Scl) for configuration-drift detection.",
  "id": "Iec61850.Client",
  "isPrerelease": true,
  "lastEdited": "2026-08-28T08:53:46.923Z",
